classDiagram
%% m_requests is QHash<quint64, QNetworkReply*>; comma-generics are not supported by Mermaid.
class HttpClient {
  -QNetworkAccessManager* m_manager
  -QHash m_requests
  -quint64 m_nextRequestId
  +qint64 MaxResponseBytes$
  +HttpClient(parent)
  +postJson(url, body, timeoutMs) quint64
  +cancel(requestId) void
  +succeeded(requestId, httpStatus, body) signal
  +failed(requestId, message, httpStatus) signal
  -finish(requestId, reply) void
  -rejectLater(requestId, message) void
}
QObject <|-- HttpClient
HttpClient *-- QNetworkAccessManager : owns
HttpClient --> QNetworkReply : tracks and releases
HttpClient ..> QTimer : per request timeout
